am":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gjz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f4832fd1-b9f7-43cc-ac57-e70f0a263345","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"今月末から僕はsnowboardと納税まわりで忙しくなる予定","ts":"1636434197.009000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"diF9S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c5fb4159-9835-47c7-8a8d-b454afce82f2","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":":goodpoem:","ts":"1636434180.008500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4C78"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a6911949-dfaf-490e-8b36-6ee3bdba41ca","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"最終回お疲れさまです","ts":"1636434133.008300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"16/z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"643247ba-97a7-41f3-b1e4-495b0e32c401","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/LumaKernel/ddc-file/pull/11\u003e","ts":"1636433337.007300","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/LumaKernel/ddc-file/pull/11|#11 Add `trailingSlashAbbr` param\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/LumaKernel/ddc-file/pull/11|#11 Add `trailingSlashAbbr` param\u003e","text":"*Problem*\n\nWhen I enable `trailingSlash` sourceParam, it shows `/` at the end of directories at the completion popup, but it also inserts the `/` which prevents inputting next directory/file smoothly.\n\n\u003chttps://asciinema.org/a/kqe3LVUD2kQFOiuf01vMSha9O|https://camo.githubusercontent.com/fefb0f8a1adbeb5d6156bc543297ddaf66e35be9892dfa3dd010f5bcc78ea113/68747470733a2f2f61736369696e656d612e6f72672f612f6b7165334c565544326b51464f6975663031764d536861394f2e737667\u003e\n\n*Solution*\n\nIntroduce `trailingSlashAbbr` to provide this functionality without breaking existing `trailingSlash`.\n\n\u003chttps://asciinema.org/a/7JvBigGxCF8lXQjXcr5unQRv1|https://camo.githubusercontent.com/45d8a24d87847573f53bf6db0f2b3ab23fd4f30d5f3516746d4777fcdc09abe7/68747470733a2f2f61736369696e656d612e6f72672f612f374a7642696747784346386c58516a58637235756e515276312e737667\u003e\n\n```\n    \" vimrc's ddc-file init_ddc() part\n    call ddc#custom#patch_global('sourceOptions', {\n          \\ 'file': {\n            \\   'mark': 'F',\n            \\   'isVolatile': v:true,\n            \\   'forceCompletionPattern': '/\\S*',\n            \\ }})\n    call ddc#custom#patch_global('sourceParams', {\n          \\ 'file': {\n            \\   'trailingSlashAbbr': v:true,\n            \\ }})\n```\n\n*Acknowledge*\n\nThanks \u003chttps://github.com/thinca|@thinca\u003e and \u003chttps://github.com/Shougo|@Shougo\u003e for helping me implementing this feature at a pair programming session.","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/LumaKernel/ddc-file|LumaKernel/ddc-file\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1636433329}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":2,"users":["U7JL1UKKL","US5UW1UNB"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+T2dx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f58cae94-9240-4a3b-afd0-f157ebb49137","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":":memo: shougoさんがまれによく使っているもの \u003chttps://asciinema.org/\u003e","ts":"1636432921.007100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EwA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"32492797-c99a-45d7-9094-44d812cbc725","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"sorterの話でもりあがってます","ts":"1636431760.006900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=Eh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5c4db8ef-6dd0-40f7-beb4-e9d134d2ac81","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"忘れていた","ts":"1636431509.006700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"bloc